t;font-size:14.6px&quot; color=&quot;#56636E&quot;&gt;the additions guard refuses any change to what is there; seven proofs per org; one-command restore&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#F2F5F8;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="g5"><mxGeometry x="18.2" y="57.6" width="614.4" height="100.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18.6px&quot; color=&quot;#004B86&quot;&gt;Standardized Reports folder&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.6px&quot; color=&quot;#56636E&quot;&gt;scheduled SQL reports in one folder; on Origin_DEV today, promoted to client orgs by the same tool when approved&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#F2F5F8;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="g5"><mxGeometry x="671" y="57.6" width="614.4" height="100.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18.6px&quot; color=&quot;#004B86&quot;&gt;Sweep after every change&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.6px&quot; color=&quot;#56636E&quot;&gt;the sign-off is regenerated; the first red row is the alert&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#F2F5F8;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="g5"><mxGeometry x="1323.8" y="57.6" width="614.4" height="100.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="loopnote" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot; color=&quot;#E6ECF2&quot;&gt;every later change re-enters at the client test org and repeats steps 10 to 19&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#E6E