gt;Database Deployment Flow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18.6px&quot;&gt;one client, from preflight to the twice-daily rolling refresh, and the objects every Standard Offering domain reads&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#E6ECF2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="77.8" y="33.6" width="1958.4" height="124.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="_legend" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.6px&quot; color=&quot;#E6ECF2&quot;&gt;Every box in the map is one database object the domains read: seven rolling snapshot tables, the SA aged-balance table with its lookup seed, and eight CMS views. Numbers are the order of one rollout; blue diamonds are gates: yes continues, no stops the rollout there. The loop under the second row is the twice-daily rolling refresh (3 months rebuilt, 24 kept; 6 months at CityCorp and Odessa).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#E6ECF2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="77.8" y="1065.6" width="1958.4" height="57.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="_footer" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#E6ECF2&quot;&gt;Origin Utility, Inc  /  Proprietary and Confidential  /  Internal Use Only&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#E6ECF2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="77.8" y="1118.4" width="1958.4" height="38.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="_layer0_0" value="&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;font style=&amp;quot;font-size:13.3px&amp;quot; color=&amp;quot;#004B86&amp;quot;&amp;gt;prod_snapshot_rollout_25_4.sh &amp;amp;lt;client&amp;amp;gt;  (steps 1 to 8, logged)&amp;lt;/font&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Courier New;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#006FAC;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#004B86;" vertex="1" parent="_layer0"><mxGeometry x="86.4" y="292.8" width="220.8" height="40.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="_layer0_1" value="&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;font style=&amp;quot;font-size:13.3px&amp;quot; color=&amp;quot;#004B86&amp;quot;&amp;gt;run_snapshot_rollout_step.py --step baseline-and-validate --clients &amp;amp;lt;c&amp;amp;gt;  (tables, procedures, baselines, ready gate, validation, install gate)&amp;lt;/font&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Courier New;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#006FAC;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#004B86;" vertex="1" parent="_layer0"><mxGeometry x="355.2" y="292.8" width="576" height="40.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="_layer0_2" value="&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;font style=&amp;quot;font-size:13.3px&amp;quot; color=&amp;quot;#004B86&amp;quot;&amp;gt;clients/post_load_snapshot_indexes_direct.sql&amp;lt;/font&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Courier New;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#006FAC;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#004B86;" vertex="1" parent="_layer0"><mxGeometry x="1228.8" y="475.2" width="211.2" height="40.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="_layer0_3" value="&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;font style=&amp;quot;font-size:13.3px&amp;quot; color=&amp;quot;#004B86&amp;quot;&amp;gt;run_snapshot_rollout_step.py --step cutover-and-validate --clients &amp;amp;lt;c&amp;amp;gt;&amp;lt;/font&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Courier New;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#006FAC;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#004B86;" vertex="1" parent="_layer0"><mxGeometry x="633.6" y="480" width="528" height="40.3" as="g