:12px&amp;quot; color=&amp;quot;#56636E&amp;quot;&amp;gt;row counts; 12 monthly totals vs source; duplicate keys; no empty table; CMS views valid; lookup seeded; ARS buckets sum to CUR_BAL; FT parity&amp;lt;/font&amp;gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Courier New;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#006FAC;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#004B86;" vertex="1" parent="_layer1"><mxGeometry x="1488" y="321.6" width="268.8" height="76.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="_layer1_2" value="&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;font style=&amp;quot;font-size:13.3px&amp;quot; color=&amp;quot;#004B86&amp;quot;&amp;gt;04 again, after the operational refresh&amp;lt;/font&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Courier New;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#006FAC;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#004B86;" vertex="1" parent="_layer1"><mxGeometry x="835.2" y="355.2" width="268.8" height="43.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>